{{Codex|The Lex is a powerful, accurate pistol that has a lower rate of fire and clip size. Very efficient at long range.}}The '''Lex''' is a pistol with high damage and very high accuracy. The weapon does not falter in long ranges, and is capable of dispatching most light armored enemies with a well-aimed headshot.

It can be sold for {{cc|5,000}}; it is also a [[weapon crafting ingredient]] for {{Weapon|Aklex}} (x2).
{{Checklist|nocategory=true|
* {{Weapon|Lex}} + {{Weapon|Lex}} → {{Weapon|Aklex}}
}}

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Puncture}} damage.
*Innate {{Pol|Madurai}} polarity.

{{Advantages|
*Very accurate.
*Very good ammunition efficiency.
}}

{{Disadvantages|
*High recoil.
}}

